4. To use RF test mode CLIs, first enter test mode, then configure channel/bandwidth/antenna/power and start TX/RX:

Note: Once RF test mode is entered via wlan-set-rf-test-mode, the WLAN stack switches to a dedicated test mode and normal WLAN CLI commands (e.g. scan, connect) are no longer functional. wlan-unset-rf-test-mode only clears the RF test configuration but does NOT restore normal operation. A board reset is required to return to normal CLI mode.

